    "This template has no photo area": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "This template is built without a photo, which suits applications where a photo is not expected. Your photo is kept and shows again on templates with a photo area.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "This template uses colour or banners. The text is still real text, but plain styles are the safest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Vorlage nutzt Farbe oder Banner. Der Text bleibt echter Text, schlichte Stile sind aber am sichersten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta plantilla usa color o franjas. El texto sigue siendo texto real, pero los estilos sencillos son los más seguros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce modèle utilise de la couleur ou des bandeaux. Le texte reste du vrai texte, mais les styles sobres sont les plus sûrs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个模板使用了颜色或横幅。文字仍是真实文字，但简洁的样式最稳妥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This text was very long, so only the first 100,000 characters were read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Text war sehr lang, daher wurden nur die ersten 100.000 Zeichen gelesen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este texto era muy largo, así que solo se leyeron los primeros 100.000 caracteres."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce texte était très long : seuls les 100 000 premiers caractères ont été lus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字过长，只读取了前 100,000 个字符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeline": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Tinted band": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "To export this document again, tap Export. Each new export starts with one short video when one is available.": {
      "comment": "Export sheet. 'Export' must match the Export button translation.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um dieses Dokument erneut zu exportieren, tippen Sie auf „Exportieren“. Jeder neue Export beginnt mit einem kurzen Video, sofern eines verfügbar ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para volver a exportar este documento, toca Exportar. Cada nueva exportación empieza con un breve vídeo cuando hay uno disponible."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour exporter à nouveau ce document, touchez Exporter. Chaque nouvel export commence par une courte vidéo lorsqu’une vidéo est disponible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需再次导出此文档，请轻点“导出”。每次新的导出都会先播放一段简短视频（如有可用视频）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To print, choose PDF above. It keeps your page layout exactly.": {
      "comment": "Export sheet",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Drucken wählen Sie oben PDF. Damit bleibt Ihr Seitenlayout exakt erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Para imprimir, elige PDF arriba. Conserva exactamente el diseño de tu página."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour imprimer, choisissez PDF ci-dessus. Il conserve exactement votre mise en page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需打印，请在上方选择 PDF，它会完整保留你的页面版式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Try a company name, a job title or part of the letter title.": {
      "comment": "Cover Letters list",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
