            "value": "Votre prénom (facultatif)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的名字（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name and a working way to reach you are at the top of the document.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Name und eine funktionierende Kontaktmöglichkeit stehen oben im Dokument."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu nombre y una forma válida de contactarte aparecen al principio del documento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre nom et un moyen valable de vous joindre figurent en haut du document."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的姓名和有效的联系方式位于文档顶部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name and contact details": {
      "comment": "Cover letter editor form",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Name und Ihre Kontaktdaten"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu nombre y datos de contacto"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre nom et vos coordonnées"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的姓名和联系方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name, title, email, phone and location in this letter will be overwritten with the values from the resume.": {
      "comment": "Cover letter editor form",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name, Position, E-Mail, Telefon und Ort in diesem Anschreiben werden durch die Angaben aus dem Lebenslauf ersetzt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu nombre, cargo, correo electrónico, teléfono y ubicación en esta carta se sustituirán por los del currículum."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre nom, votre fonction, votre e-mail, votre téléphone et votre lieu dans cette lettre seront remplacés par ceux du CV."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此求职信中的姓名、职位、电子邮件、电话和所在地将被简历中的信息覆盖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your photo is kept but hidden, because %@ has no photo area.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Your photo shows on the %@ templates marked Photo. Templates without a photo area keep it hidden. Employers in some countries prefer resumes without a photo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "Your resumes, cover letters and drafts cannot be recovered afterwards unless you saved a backup file.": {
      "comment": "Profile. Second delete-all confirmation. Must be precise.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihre Lebensläufe, Anschreiben und Entwürfe können danach nicht wiederhergestellt werden, es sei denn, Sie haben eine Backup-Datei gesichert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después no podrás recuperar tus currículums, cartas de presentación ni borradores, salvo que hayas guardado un archivo de copia de seguridad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos CV, lettres de motivation et brouillons ne pourront pas être récupérés ensuite, sauf si vous avez enregistré un fichier de sauvegarde."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除后，你的简历、求职信和草稿将无法恢复，除非你已保存备份文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your summary has %lld words. A couple of sentences gives a reader more to work with.": {
      "comment": "The number is always under 20.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ihr Kurzprofil hat %lld Wort. Ein paar Sätze geben mehr Anhaltspunkte."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ihr Kurzprofil hat %lld Wörter. Ein paar Sätze geben mehr Anhaltspunkte."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Your summary has %lld word. A couple of sentences gives a reader more to work with."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Your summary has %lld words. A couple of sentences gives a reader more to work with."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Tu resumen tiene %lld palabra. Un par de frases da más información al lector."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Tu resumen tiene %lld palabras. Un par de frases da más información al lector."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Votre résumé compte %lld mot. Quelques phrases donnent davantage d'éléments au lecteur."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Votre résumé compte %lld mots. Quelques phrases donnent davantage d'éléments au lecteur."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的个人简介约有 %lld 个词。写上两三句话，能给阅读者更多信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your summary has %lld words. Around 40 to 90 words is easier to read at a glance.": {
      "comment": "The number is always more than 120. For Chinese the app counts about one word per two characters.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Kurzprofil hat %lld Wörter. Etwa 40 bis 90 Wörter lassen sich auf einen Blick besser lesen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu resumen tiene %lld palabras. Entre 40 y 90 palabras se lee mejor de un vistazo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre résumé compte %lld mots. Entre 40 et 90 mots, il se lit plus facilement d'un coup d'œil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的个人简介约有 %lld 个词。控制在 40 到 90 个词左右更便于快速阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
